The final license for this codebase is intentionally undetermined while
the project is in pre-release. The current intent is:

  - Client / SvelteKit application code: GPLv3 or AGPLv3.
  - Protocol specifications and reference test vectors: MIT or Apache-2.0.

Until a license is formally adopted, all rights are reserved. You may
inspect, audit, run, and develop locally for the purposes of code review,
security analysis, and contribution evaluation. You may NOT redistribute
modified or unmodified copies, fork the project as a public-facing
service, or use the source as the basis for a competing product.

This file will be replaced with a final OSI-approved license before the
v1.0 release.
